From CHBlackjack (https://github.com/bateske/CHBlackjack, Apache-2.0), by way
of CHChess and CHBackgammon: the input and frame pacing (src/CHGame.*),
palette, drawing, outlined lettering, effects, sound sequencer, flash saving,
debug protocol and the PC simulator and tools, adapted here; CHBackgammon's
display font (tools/art/font.txt, its capitals); and CHChess's pointing glove
(tools/art/hand.png). CHBlackjack is a derivative of "Blackjack" for the
Arduboy by Press Play On Tape (Apache-2.0); the 3x5 pixel font in
src/gfx/Draw.cpp is Press Play On Tape's.

The tiles' letters (tools/art/tilefont.txt, by tools/tilefont.py, from
CHCrossword's) are rasterized from DejaVu Serif Bold and Serif Condensed
Bold. DejaVu is freely redistributable: Bitstream Vera
Fonts Copyright (c) 2003 Bitstream, Inc.; DejaVu changes are in the public
domain (https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html).

The SD card reader (src/sd, and the simulator's card in tools/chsim/host/
sd_host.cpp and VCard.h) is CHSd, the library this game shares with
CHCrossword and CHWordWheel: HypeRunner's clean-room SPI-mode driver and FAT
reader, cut down to read-only single-block reads:

