The words (src/dict/DictData.cpp, tools/dict/core.txt, and the WORDS.DIC that
tools/dict/build_sd.py writes) are from the ENABLE word list (Enhanced North
American Benchmark Lexicon) by Alan Beale and M. Cooper, which its authors
placed in the public domain.

Which of those words are in the built-in list was decided by how often each
appears in print, from Peter Norvig's list of common words
(norvig.com/google-books-common-words.txt), compiled from the Google Books
Ngrams data (Google, Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported). The counts
are used when the list is built and are not part of this repository or the
game.

Everything else - the rules, the dictionary formats and their tools, the
